# Performance Optimization - SLAM25 Project

## Core Performance Principles

This Poetry Slam members area follows **simplified performance patterns** that prioritize speed, efficiency, and user experience.

## React Query Optimization

### ✅ Query Configuration
```javascript
// ✅ Optimized query settings
const { data, isLoading } = useQuery({
  queryKey: ['participants'],
  queryFn: fetchParticipants,
  staleTime: 5 * 60 * 1000, // 5 minutes - data stays fresh
  cacheTime: 10 * 60 * 1000, // 10 minutes - cache duration
  refetchInterval: 30000, // 30 seconds - polling interval
  refetchOnWindowFocus: false, // Don't refetch on window focus
  refetchOnMount: false, // Don't refetch on component mount
  retry: 3, // Retry failed requests 3 times
  retryDelay: attemptIndex => Math.min(1000 * 2 ** attemptIndex, 30000)
});
```

### ✅ Query Invalidation
```javascript
// ✅ Smart invalidation
const queryClient = useQueryClient();

// Invalidate specific queries
const invalidateParticipants = () => {
  queryClient.invalidateQueries(['participants']);
};

// Invalidate related queries
const invalidateAll = () => {
  queryClient.invalidateQueries();
};
```

### ✅ Background Updates
```javascript
// ✅ Background refetching
const { data } = useQuery({
  queryKey: ['participants'],
  queryFn: fetchParticipants,
  refetchInterval: 30000,
  refetchIntervalInBackground: true, // Continue polling in background
  refetchOnWindowFocus: true // Refetch when user returns
});
```

## Component Optimization

### ✅ Memoization Patterns
```javascript
// ✅ Expensive calculations
const expensiveValue = useMemo(() => {
  return participants.reduce((sum, participant) => {
    return sum + participant.score;
  }, 0);
}, [participants]);

// ✅ Callback memoization
const handleClick = useCallback(() => {
  setIsOpen(!isOpen);
}, [isOpen]);

// ✅ Component memoization
const ParticipantCard = memo(({ participant, onEdit }) => {
  return (
    <div onClick={() => onEdit(participant.id)}>
      <h3>{participant.name}</h3>
      <p>{participant.region}</p>
    </div>
  );
});
```

### ✅ Lazy Loading
```javascript
// ✅ Lazy component loading
const AdminDashboard = lazy(() => import('./AdminDashboard.jsx'));
const AdminRoutes = lazy(() => import('./AdminRoutes.jsx'));

// ✅ Lazy route loading
const routes = [
  {
